  <Footnote id="cd1b1818-7e47-4830-92ac-a27a1ac826cf">
    Please note that, due to limitations in the specification language and
    libraries, we currently cannot express actual floating point values. We
    therefore substitute a single
    <Term type="expression">JsonFloat</Term>
    value in the specification to conceptually represent the full set of values
    expressible as IEEE754 binary64 values.
  </Footnote>

